514
00:19:42,360 --> 00:19:43,761
抱歉我来晚了
Sorry I was late.

515
00:19:44,020 --> 00:19:45,970
有个烟鬼[警察]摆了一个补熊夹[测速]
A smokey set up a bear trap,

516
00:19:45,980 --> 00:19:48,140
害我得倒退锤子[减速]
and I had to back off the hammer.

517
00:19:48,260 --> 00:19:50,200
我很快就帮你把幼儿安全椅拿出来
I'll get your carseat in no time.

518
00:19:50,300 --> 00:19:51,241
其他搬家工人呢
Where are the movers?

519
00:19:52,720 --> 00:19:55,720
他们算什么搬家工人啊  搬箱子的男人罢了
Those were no movers. They were just men carrying boxes.

520
00:19:59,060 --> 00:20:01,721
里面的东西是在我们打包前就坏了的对吧
Those things were broken before we packed them, huh?

521
00:20:02,260 --> 00:20:03,960
我们刚才有把安全椅安装正确吗
Are we sure we put the carseat in right?

522
00:20:04,100 --> 00:20:06,533
什么"我们"  我不知道啊  我觉得有点晃
What do you mean, we? I-I-I don't know. It felt shaky!

523
00:20:06,839 --> 00:20:08,349
天啊  真糟糕  情况真的很糟糕
Oh, God, this is bad. This is really bad.

524
00:20:08,370 --> 00:20:09,820
我们没有尿布  也没有奶粉
We don't have diapers, we don't have formula...

525
00:20:09,830 --> 00:20:10,657
我们连自己住哪里都不知道
I don't even know where we live.

526
00:20:10,677 --> 00:20:12,434
如果有人跟我们要地址  我们该说什么
If somebody asks for an address, what am I supposed to say?

527
00:20:12,455 --> 00:20:13,540
住"新家那里"
"Some new house someplace"?

528
00:20:13,660 --> 00:20:14,646
-两位  -要命啦
- Guys. - Ohhh, my gosh!

529
00:20:15,200 --> 00:20:17,360
天啊  我们真糟糕
O-O-Oh, my God. Oh, my God. We're awful.

530
00:20:17,680 --> 00:20:18,781
我们都还没关心过你
We haven't even checked in with you.

531
00:20:18,822 --> 00:20:20,412
你...  你一定也吓坏了吧
You... You must be freaking out, too.

532
00:20:20,800 --> 00:20:23,301
我没有  你们也没有
No, I'm not, and neither are you.

533
00:20:23,500 --> 00:20:24,966
这只是你们遇到事情的流程
This is just your process.

534
00:20:25,414 --> 00:20:26,552
你们会先歇斯底里
You get hysterical,

535
00:20:26,978 --> 00:20:28,410
然后开始过度担心每个小细节
you worry about every detail,

536
00:20:28,420 --> 00:20:29,761
然后开始互相怪罪对方
then you turn on each other...

537
00:20:29,820 --> 00:20:31,287
-我们才没有呢  -我们的确是这样
- No, we don't! - Yes, we do.

538
00:20:31,328 --> 00:20:33,870
-你怎么敢这么说  -在所有的发神经过去后
- How dare you. - And after all that craziness,

539
00:20:33,880 --> 00:20:36,260
当真正关键的时刻来临  你们...
when it really matters the most, you...

540
00:20:37,180 --> 00:20:38,180
-怎么样  -我们会怎么做
- W-What? - W-W-What do we do?

541
00:20:43,380 --> 00:20:44,313
我们的儿子
Our son.

542
00:20:44,354 --> 00:20:46,180
他真好看
He's beautiful.

543
00:20:48,040 --> 00:20:49,601
我们能行的
We got this.

544
00:20:50,522 --> 00:20:52,394
-是的  -对
- Yeah. - Yeah.

545
00:20:55,780 --> 00:20:56,413
好  歌洛莉亚说
Okay, so, Gloria said

546
00:20:56,474 --> 00:20:58,494
她把乔以前的摇篮放在我们卧室了
she set up Joe's old bassinet in our bedroom,

547
00:20:58,555 --> 00:21:00,901
我们也有足够的尿布够撑到早上
and I think we have enough diapers to last us till morning.

548
00:21:01,778 --> 00:21:02,636
别忘了撑著他的脑袋
D-Don't forget to support his head.

549
00:21:02,881 --> 00:21:04,718
我知道  又不是第一次
I will. It's not my first rodeo.

550
00:21:05,289 --> 00:21:07,201
我等不及带他第一次去看牛仔表演了
Oh, I can't wait to take him to his first rodeo.

551
00:21:07,740 --> 00:21:09,555
好  她在问我们应该什么时间
Okay, um, she's asking what time

552
00:21:09,596 --> 00:21:11,261
带大家来跟宝宝见第一面
she should bring everyone by for the baby reveal.

553
00:21:11,580 --> 00:21:12,374
我不知道  或许...
I don't know, may...

554
00:21:13,432 --> 00:21:15,221
或许今晚我们先四个人自己过吧
Maybe it should just be the four of us tonight, huh?

555
00:21:16,900 --> 00:21:19,492
我想...  我终于知道
You know, I... think I finally realized

556
00:21:19,533 --> 00:21:21,500
这房子一直以来缺的是什么了
what this house has been missing all along.

557
00:21:23,630 --> 00:21:25,550
-嵌入式灯具  -没错
- Recessed lighting. - Totally.
